            "review_title": "Review at Xocoati Saigon",
            "review_text": "Đan L\n26 contributions\n1\nA truly hidden-gem for Cocoa lovers!! ☕️\nApr 2025 • Solo\n🍫 The most impressive thing is the Hot Cacao drinks \nI chose a “Xocoati by Maya” one with cinnamon and pure cocoa powder. They cooked everything in a pot, so interesting! Their location is hidden in an alley (District 1). You should go there by Grab or Taxi. And don’t forget to check the GG map.\n\nXocoati is a very local destination - must visit place if you love enjoying Cacaoo✨\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nThey open from 13:00pm to 22:30pm (Monday to Friday) and in Weekend is 10:00am to 22:30pm. I think visitors should inbox for Xocoati Saigon\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 16, 2025",
